# Plantify Capstone – Project Rules

## Tong quan Du an
- **Ten:** Plantify – He thong nhan dien thuc vat, chan doan benh & cham soc cay tich hop AI
- **Nhom:** SEP490 / G126 | Mentor: TS. Bui Trung Hieu
- **Platform:** Mobile App (React Native + Expo) + Backend REST API + Web CMS (React.js)
- **Timeline:** 07/09/2026 – 24/12/2026 | 5 thanh vien

## Tech Stack

### Mobile (`mobile/`)
- **Framework:** React Native + Expo (~51) + Expo Router (~3.5)
- **State:** Zustand (`store/`)
- **HTTP:** Axios (`src/services/api.js`)
- **UI:** React Native Paper + @expo/vector-icons
- **Storage:** AsyncStorage
- **Ngon ngu:** JavaScript (.js / .jsx) — KHONG dung TypeScript

### Backend (`backend/`)
- **Runtime:** Node.js + Express
- **DB:** MongoDB Atlas + Mongoose
- **Auth:** JWT (Access Token 1h) + bcryptjs
- **Module system:** CommonJS (`require` / `module.exports`)
- **Tich hop:** OpenWeatherMap API, Google Gemini API, SePay Webhook (HMAC), FCM, SMTP OTP

### Web CMS (tuong lai)
- **Framework:** React.js – danh cho Admin & Manager

## Cau truc Du an

### Backend (`backend/src/`)
```
src/
├── config/          # database.js, env.js, cors.js
├── models/          # *.model.js (Mongoose models)
├── routes/          # *.routes.js & index.js (API routes)
├── controllers/     # *.controller.js (Request/Response handling)
├── services/        # *.service.js (Business logic & DB queries)
├── middlewares/     # *.middleware.js (auth, error, validate)
├── validators/      # *.validator.js (Zod schemas)
├── integrations/    # External services (ai, email, payment, weather, push-notification)
├── jobs/            # Background / Cron jobs
├── utils/           # api-response.js, pagination.js
├── scripts/         # seed.js
├── app.js
└── server.js
```

### Mobile (`mobile/`)
```
mobile/
├── app/             # Expo Router – file-based routing
│   ├── _layout.js
│   └── (tabs)/
├── src/
│   ├── components/  # Component dung chung + component theo domain
│   │   └── home/    # Component dac thu HomeScreen
│   ├── features/    # <- MUC TIEU: to chuc theo domain (api + hooks + components)
│   │   └── <domain>/
│   │       ├── api.js
│   │       ├── hooks/
│   │       └── components/
│   ├── services/    # api.js (axios instance), authService, plantService, storageService
│   ├── theme/       # colors, spacing, typography, index
│   └── utils/       # constants, formatters, validators
├── store/           # Zustand stores: authStore, cartStore, favoritesStore
└── app.json
```

## Business Rules (Quan trong – Khong duoc vi pham)

### Tai khoan & Auth
- Tai khoan Free: toi da **3 cay** trong My Garden, toi da **5 cay** yeu thich
- Chi tai khoan **Pro** moi duoc dung AI Scan benh cay
- Sai mat khau **5 lan** → khoa tai khoan **15 phut**
- Ma OTP het han sau **5 phut** (BR-06)
- JWT Access Token song **1 gio** (BR-07)
- Mat khau ma hoa bang **bcryptjs**

### Lich cham soc & Dieu tri
- Do am >= 85% hoac co mua → tu dong **hoan lich tuoi 24 gio** (BR-26, OpenWeatherMap)
- Khi cay dang co phac do dieu tri → lich cham soc thuong bi `is_paused = true`
- Phac do dieu tri: **14 ngay**, co reminder FCM hang ngay

### Tai chinh (SePay / Wallet)
- Giao dich da hoan tat la **bat bien** (khong sua, khong xoa)
- Xac thuc SePay bang **HMAC signature**

### Soft Delete
- **Khong hard delete** tai khoan nguoi dung – chi deactivate/khoa

### AI Disclaimer (LI-06 – Bat buoc hien thi)
Man hinh ket qua chan doan PHAI hien thi:
> "AI disease diagnosis results and treatment guides are for urban agriculture reference only. Actual plant recovery depends on specific plant varieties and real-world care conditions."

