## Quy tac Code

### Ten file & Thu muc
| Loai | Quy uoc | Vi du |
|------|---------|-------|
| Folder | `kebab-case` | `my-garden`, `plant-disease` |
| File BE | `camelCase` | `plant.controller.js` |
| Component Mobile | `PascalCase` | `PlantCard.js` |
| Logic Mobile | `camelCase` | `api.js`, `authService.js` |

### Backend
- `routes.js` → chi dinh nghia route + gan middleware
- `controller.js` → nhan request, goi service, tra response
- `service.js` → toan bo business logic + DB query
- `model.js` → Mongoose schema
- **KHONG** de logic DB truc tiep trong controller

### Mobile
- `store/` → chi Zustand global state (auth, cart, favorites)
- `src/services/` → goi API, AsyncStorage
- `src/components/` → UI thuan, khong chua business logic
- Screen trong `app/` chi compose UI + goi hook/service

## Workflow Phat trien
Lam tung lat nho theo thu tu:
```
BE: model -> service -> controller -> routes -> dang ky app.js
Mobile: service -> store/hook -> component -> screen
```

## Commit Convention
```
<type>(<scope>): <mo ta tieng Viet, thi hien tai>
```
| Type | Scope vi du |
|------|------------|
| `feat` | `auth`, `garden`, `scan`, `schedule`, `payment`, `cms` |
| `fix` | `fcm`, `weather`, `jwt` |
| `refactor` | ten module |
| `chore` | `env`, `deps` |

Vi du: `feat(scan): them man hinh chan doan benh la`

**Sau moi lat code xong -> dung, nhac commit!**

## Comment Style (Bat buoc)
- Dau moi file: comment ten file + muc dich (tieng Viet)
- Ham quan trong: dung JSDoc (@param, @returns)
- Khoi logic lon: phan chia bang `// === PHAN X: ... ===`
- Comment bang **tieng Viet**, ngan gon, ro rang

